WEBVTT

00:01.432 --> 00:10.725
[SPEAKER_01]: Third Wealsun in the evening as Paul Rivero returns to Monmurg on the coast air from his adventures on Helm Island.

00:12.282 --> 00:22.451
[SPEAKER_01]: All right, so what happens is the group returns to Monmurg on the Kosair and they dock at the Royal Docks.

00:23.152 --> 00:30.939
[SPEAKER_01]: This is not normally where these ships dock, however, for whatever reason they were given permission to do that, most likely because you were on the boat.

00:31.359 --> 00:32.160
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, I figured.

00:33.655 --> 00:45.925
[SPEAKER_01]: After you dock, basically what happens is an attendant says to you and Jude, you guys are wanted to debrief with Prince Jeon and Lord Jamis.

00:45.945 --> 00:55.092
[SPEAKER_01]: Jude is supposed to go talk to Lord Jamis, and you are supposed to go talk to Jeon.

00:56.193 --> 01:00.936
[SPEAKER_01]: Lord Jamis does not have the authority to debrief you, and that's kind of why that is the case.

01:01.037 --> 01:02.598
[SPEAKER_01]: Jeon wants to basically get

01:04.517 --> 01:06.779
[SPEAKER_01]: What you observed directly from your mouth.

01:07.719 --> 01:07.959
[SPEAKER_01]: Right?

01:09.420 --> 01:09.881
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

01:10.681 --> 01:25.752
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you're led up the stairway, the private stairway, passed several guards, into the Prince's, you know, royal palace.

01:26.692 --> 01:27.653
[SPEAKER_01]: Your home, too.

01:28.133 --> 01:28.354
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

01:29.714 --> 01:32.957
[SPEAKER_01]: And led to John's office.

01:36.674 --> 01:45.441
[SPEAKER_01]: When you enter, he's basically already there, and he has somewhat of a concerned look on his face.

01:45.462 --> 01:58.673
[SPEAKER_01]: He's kind of like looking at this map of what you can tell is the outer islands, the Salinmoor Bay to the north, and then the Jerley Bay to the south.

01:59.573 --> 02:01.475
[SPEAKER_01]: But when you walk in, he says, Paul.

02:03.822 --> 02:04.723
[SPEAKER_01]: Sit down, please.

02:05.363 --> 02:06.043
[SPEAKER_01]: Who says this to me?

02:06.364 --> 02:06.764
[SPEAKER_01]: Jeon.

02:06.924 --> 02:07.624
[SPEAKER_01]: Jeon, okay.

02:08.705 --> 02:09.125
[SPEAKER_01]: I sit down.

02:10.806 --> 02:14.469
[SPEAKER_01]: I heard there was some trouble on Helm Island.

02:14.849 --> 02:15.229
[SPEAKER_00]: Oh yeah.

02:18.932 --> 02:27.117
[SPEAKER_01]: I've gotten reports that the ship we sent you on was overwhelmed.

02:27.537 --> 02:27.757
[SPEAKER_01]: Yep.

02:29.598 --> 02:31.539
[SPEAKER_01]: There were 300 marines on that ship.

02:32.060 --> 02:32.420
[SPEAKER_01]: All gone.

02:34.041 --> 02:37.523
[SPEAKER_00]: Maybe a hundred made it off.

02:39.564 --> 02:40.625
[SPEAKER_01]: And it is sahaugin.

02:41.305 --> 02:41.605
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

02:43.006 --> 02:45.347
[SPEAKER_00]: There's also hobgoblins that had taken over the island.

02:49.970 --> 02:51.030
[SPEAKER_00]: Tell me more of that.

02:52.651 --> 02:53.552
[SPEAKER_00]: Fairwind is a traitor.

02:57.494 --> 02:58.334
[SPEAKER_01]: How do you know this?

02:59.034 --> 02:59.895
[SPEAKER_00]: We... okay.

03:01.419 --> 03:02.980
[SPEAKER_00]: Is Jamis in the room with this?

03:03.240 --> 03:03.440
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

03:03.701 --> 03:04.121
[SPEAKER_01]: Oh, he's not.

03:04.181 --> 03:05.221
[SPEAKER_01]: It's just you and Jeon.

03:05.542 --> 03:05.822
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

03:06.002 --> 03:10.005
[SPEAKER_01]: Obviously, he wants to get your point of view... First.

03:10.785 --> 03:14.768
[SPEAKER_01]: And in private, which is... Sus.

03:16.008 --> 03:22.733
[SPEAKER_01]: Maybe not sus, but I think what that kind of tells you is that he's not just completely trusting everybody else right now.

03:23.313 --> 03:25.094
[SPEAKER_01]: He wants to know what you know... First hand.

03:25.214 --> 03:25.514
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

03:25.615 --> 03:27.196
[SPEAKER_01]: Before you say it to everybody else.

03:27.216 --> 03:29.337
[SPEAKER_01]: So, I'll explain to him, um...

03:30.907 --> 03:33.671
[SPEAKER_00]: We sailed to the island, you know, we got there ready.

03:34.652 --> 03:37.115
[SPEAKER_00]: I said, you know, be ready in case it was taken over.

03:37.155 --> 03:41.601
[SPEAKER_00]: We had dropped 50 Marines on one shore side.

03:41.621 --> 03:43.023
[SPEAKER_00]: I explained which one that is to them.

03:43.043 --> 03:43.663
[SPEAKER_00]: Southern Beacon.

03:43.904 --> 03:44.184
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

03:44.605 --> 03:46.888
[SPEAKER_00]: And then we had docked our ship in the harbor.

03:48.362 --> 04:00.391
[SPEAKER_00]: Me, Jude, and 20 other Marines got off onto the docks and started scouting ahead, and all of a sudden we came under fire from the towers up above, so we had to storm that.

04:00.811 --> 04:06.315
[SPEAKER_00]: Me and Jude thought about turning around, but we looked behind and saw Sahaugin tearing up the ship.

04:07.096 --> 04:08.277
[SPEAKER_00]: Like, just swarming it.

04:08.757 --> 04:11.199
[SPEAKER_00]: So, everyone on that ship was gone.

04:11.219 --> 04:16.103
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm pretty sure it sank and is in the harbor, and everyone on it's dead.

04:18.427 --> 04:21.008
[SPEAKER_00]: We stormed inside and we got to the barracks.

04:22.308 --> 04:27.270
[SPEAKER_00]: We met up with some Marines that were resisting there that were stationed on the Helm Island.

04:28.090 --> 04:31.971
[SPEAKER_00]: They knew nothing about what happened to Fairwind or anything.

04:32.031 --> 04:34.252
[SPEAKER_01]: Now those were Fairwind's men.

04:34.552 --> 04:34.792
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

04:36.497 --> 04:38.360
[SPEAKER_00]: You said Farrowind was a traitor though.

04:38.720 --> 04:40.162
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, so here's where it gets interesting.

04:40.763 --> 04:49.375
[SPEAKER_00]: So they didn't know anything about like how the hobgoblins had gotten into the helm or if there's any marines fighting left or what was aboard Farrowind.

04:50.470 --> 04:54.371
[SPEAKER_00]: But they were just stationed in there, you know, holding.

04:55.171 --> 04:56.292
[SPEAKER_00]: So...

04:56.332 --> 04:57.752
[SPEAKER_00]: So they were under siege as well?

04:57.972 --> 04:59.072
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, they were under siege as well.

04:59.713 --> 05:02.954
[SPEAKER_00]: We linked up with them and we decided, I made a plan with them.

05:03.094 --> 05:09.135
[SPEAKER_00]: Me and a group of Marines decided to storm the helm by going up over the wall.

05:10.396 --> 05:13.176
[SPEAKER_00]: And we had the other Marines that were left to create a diversion.

05:13.196 --> 05:15.177
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't really know what's out of them, but...

05:16.862 --> 05:20.204
[SPEAKER_00]: We snuck inside and we snuck around the helm.

05:20.264 --> 05:27.207
[SPEAKER_00]: We got to Lord Fairwind's safe room, I guess, where I thought he would be.

05:27.507 --> 05:28.307
[SPEAKER_01]: The Inner Sanctum.

05:28.408 --> 05:29.228
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, the Inner Sanctum.

05:30.549 --> 05:43.415
[SPEAKER_00]: And I had scouted ahead and I could see and hear visibly, like I saw him dealing, who was he dealing with?

05:43.615 --> 05:43.935
[SPEAKER_00]: The Toli.

05:44.547 --> 05:45.187
[SPEAKER_00]: The Toli?

05:45.768 --> 05:47.729
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, he was making deals with the Toli.

05:47.749 --> 05:50.891
[SPEAKER_00]: He was talking to them, standing around in the same room with them walking.

05:52.552 --> 05:57.315
[SPEAKER_01]: So, wait, there were Toli in the hill at that time?

05:57.415 --> 05:57.615
[SPEAKER_00]: Yep.

06:00.417 --> 06:01.578
[SPEAKER_01]: How do you know they were Toli?

06:02.098 --> 06:03.839
[SPEAKER_00]: I saw them and we captured them.

06:07.682 --> 06:08.182
[SPEAKER_01]: Interesting.

06:08.522 --> 06:08.843
[SPEAKER_00]: Go on.

06:09.916 --> 06:20.246
[SPEAKER_00]: So you actually witnessed Ward Fairwind talking to them, walking around in the same room with them making deals.

06:20.266 --> 06:21.467
[SPEAKER_00]: What were they talking about?

06:22.488 --> 06:25.852
[SPEAKER_00]: They were talking about removing the powder from Helma.

06:25.892 --> 06:28.895
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, they were talking about removing the powder that kept away the sahaugin.

06:31.635 --> 06:38.378
[SPEAKER_01]: And then another thing that Fairwind said is, well, what the Toli said is, we noticed you took most of it for yourself.

06:39.278 --> 06:43.960
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, and so I explained to him that Lord Fairwind, that I think he was trying to split away or something.

06:44.060 --> 06:45.101
[SPEAKER_00]: That was his idea.

06:46.221 --> 06:48.362
[SPEAKER_00]: He took most of the powder for himself.

06:49.543 --> 06:53.664
[SPEAKER_00]: So he removed the powder from Helm Island.

06:54.045 --> 06:54.565
[SPEAKER_00]: Most, yeah.

06:54.605 --> 06:57.206
[SPEAKER_00]: And that's how the Sahaugin got up and swarmed it.

07:01.925 --> 07:03.570
[SPEAKER_01]: No, they said you had four barrels.

07:05.226 --> 07:06.147
[SPEAKER_01]: Of the stuff.

07:07.007 --> 07:14.311
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, so after we take Lord Farrowing, I put him under arrest and, you know, he gave a big fit about it.

07:14.351 --> 07:15.632
[SPEAKER_00]: He tried to play guilty.

07:15.832 --> 07:16.292
[SPEAKER_00]: He's not.

07:17.113 --> 07:19.214
[SPEAKER_00]: Um, we took one Toli alive.

07:19.874 --> 07:31.741
[SPEAKER_00]: We moved down to the, uh, secret cave system that is, was unknown, um, along the back coastline behind the castle or keep, whatever.

07:32.662 --> 07:32.862
[SPEAKER_00]: Um,

07:34.677 --> 07:38.221
[SPEAKER_00]: We were walking down the stairs over on the side of this cave.

07:39.502 --> 07:40.704
[SPEAKER_00]: All of a sudden we were spotted.

07:43.446 --> 07:48.252
[SPEAKER_00]: We killed Toli and threw him over the side into the water because he was a dead weight.

07:50.218 --> 07:54.102
[SPEAKER_00]: Lord Fairwind, I was trying to get to the front, pushed me off over the side.

07:54.182 --> 07:55.143
[SPEAKER_00]: I fell in the water.

07:56.023 --> 07:59.186
[SPEAKER_00]: I got pulled back up though, but he threw himself over.

07:59.647 --> 08:00.667
[SPEAKER_00]: Or no, he got pushed over.

08:01.708 --> 08:02.509
[SPEAKER_00]: So he escaped.

08:02.829 --> 08:03.830
[SPEAKER_00]: Don't know what happened to him.

08:03.930 --> 08:04.491
[SPEAKER_00]: He could be dead.

08:04.511 --> 08:05.191
[SPEAKER_00]: He could be alive.

08:05.592 --> 08:05.932
[SPEAKER_00]: Don't know.

08:06.713 --> 08:10.856
[SPEAKER_00]: But we were able to fight and kill our way down there, the hobgoblins.

08:11.917 --> 08:12.057
[SPEAKER_00]: We

08:14.218 --> 08:15.079
[SPEAKER_00]: Built a raft.

08:15.119 --> 08:16.080
[SPEAKER_00]: Is that what we did?

08:16.460 --> 08:18.922
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, we built a raft and we sailed out of there.

08:20.243 --> 08:24.967
[SPEAKER_00]: We took four barrels and we were able to keep the sahaugin off as we got out of there.

08:25.107 --> 08:26.188
[SPEAKER_01]: How many barrels are there?

08:29.030 --> 08:31.012
[SPEAKER_00]: Twenty-five, I think, was our count.

08:31.072 --> 08:32.793
[SPEAKER_00]: We took four because that's what we could take.

08:33.454 --> 08:34.855
[SPEAKER_01]: And the rest were removed?

08:36.256 --> 08:37.357
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, everything else was gone.

08:46.737 --> 08:51.602
[SPEAKER_01]: Who else witnessed Fairwind speaking to the Toli agents?

08:51.902 --> 08:53.043
[SPEAKER_00]: Unfortunately, nobody else.

08:53.083 --> 08:53.784
[SPEAKER_00]: It was just me.

08:57.467 --> 09:02.532
[SPEAKER_01]: So you're the only one that has definitive witness to his betrayal.

09:06.595 --> 09:09.058
[SPEAKER_01]: Your compatriots, how much have you told them about his?

09:13.230 --> 09:13.590
[SPEAKER_00]: His what?

09:13.890 --> 09:14.290
[SPEAKER_00]: Treason.

09:15.091 --> 09:20.832
[SPEAKER_00]: I told them that he is a traitor, I told them that he was making deals with Toli, and that's really it.

09:20.872 --> 09:22.633
[SPEAKER_00]: I didn't get too specific about it, but...

09:25.813 --> 09:26.934
[SPEAKER_00]: They believed me over him.

09:27.734 --> 09:42.838
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, it doesn't really make sense, you know, because, in fact, what he told, what he told, Alden Reyes, he said that they just, he put all of his men, like, he had them all give up their arms and put them under ground or whatever, like, in the

09:44.857 --> 09:45.879
[SPEAKER_00]: Holdings, I don't know.

09:45.999 --> 09:51.150
[SPEAKER_00]: We never found the Marines that he had, but they basically just let the hobgoblins walk in.

09:51.170 --> 09:51.271
[SPEAKER_00]: So...

09:53.278 --> 09:54.479
[SPEAKER_00]: That doesn't sound very...

09:54.579 --> 09:59.661
[SPEAKER_01]: So it's your opinion that Fairwind allowed the hobgoblins to take over the helm, and his men were...

09:59.981 --> 10:02.663
[SPEAKER_00]: The hobgoblins were working with Toli, we believe.

10:02.863 --> 10:12.168
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, which is strange, even though the Duke of Berghof is known to employ hobgoblin mercenaries, so there's some involvement of him in this as well.

10:12.328 --> 10:14.369
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, and they were red, the hobgoblins.

10:14.489 --> 10:15.950
[SPEAKER_01]: I don't know if that's...

10:16.310 --> 10:17.130
[SPEAKER_01]: I've seen them before.

10:17.170 --> 10:18.791
[SPEAKER_01]: They're red-skinned men.

10:18.811 --> 10:20.172
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, I've never seen them.

10:21.442 --> 10:28.024
[SPEAKER_01]: They live in the mountains, the crystal mist, which the Duke of Berghof, his duchy, backs up against it.

10:28.344 --> 10:31.746
[SPEAKER_01]: So he has some dealings with them.

10:33.126 --> 10:40.709
[SPEAKER_01]: They're easier handled actually than most humanoids are, but still this is very disconcerting that they were used in this situation.

10:42.232 --> 10:46.335
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, that's basically... Is there any idea how they got on the island?

10:46.895 --> 10:48.696
