11:02.966 --> 11:05.087
[SPEAKER_01]: I assume that's the first squad that came off.

11:05.247 --> 11:06.008
[SPEAKER_00]: I'm pretty sure, yeah.

11:06.028 --> 11:06.748
[SPEAKER_00]: That there was danger.

11:06.789 --> 11:07.029
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

11:09.298 --> 11:13.439
[SPEAKER_01]: And basically they told us not to send any more ships until things were all clear.

11:15.640 --> 11:16.300
[SPEAKER_01]: The sahaugin.

11:17.660 --> 11:19.001
[SPEAKER_01]: I assume that's why.

11:19.161 --> 11:20.341
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

11:23.162 --> 11:26.503
[SPEAKER_01]: We received that just after you landed.

11:27.423 --> 11:31.664
[SPEAKER_01]: So I assume that when your ship was being attacked we were warmed off because of that threat.

11:34.885 --> 11:35.565
