11:37.972 --> 11:43.156
[SPEAKER_01]: But from what I'm hearing, it is okay now for us to proceed.

11:43.316 --> 11:45.958
[SPEAKER_01]: We might want to take some barrels with you.

11:46.699 --> 11:47.259
[SPEAKER_01]: Of course.

11:50.033 --> 11:53.015
[SPEAKER_00]: Like I said, I don't know really what happened with those marines in the barracks.

11:54.555 --> 11:59.678
[SPEAKER_00]: There's probably definitely some hobgoblins still on the island.

12:00.058 --> 12:04.881
[SPEAKER_00]: So there was this big ship that you could see sometimes in the distance that would break through the fog.

12:05.781 --> 12:12.065
[SPEAKER_00]: That's where they were like moving off the powder and that's where they were holding most of their shit I guess.

12:13.025 --> 12:14.186
[SPEAKER_00]: But that ship left.

12:14.406 --> 12:16.047
[SPEAKER_00]: And that was the Toli ship?

12:17.458 --> 12:17.818
[SPEAKER_01]: What was it?

12:17.838 --> 12:18.638
[SPEAKER_01]: It was like a giant...

12:18.798 --> 12:19.859
[SPEAKER_01]: It was called Sea Ghost.

12:19.959 --> 12:20.819
[SPEAKER_01]: It was a Sea Ghost.

12:21.319 --> 12:26.620
[SPEAKER_01]: And you had heard people talk that Kane Tolley was the guy that captained that ship.

12:26.640 --> 12:29.361
[SPEAKER_00]: We think that Kane Tolley was the captain of the ship.

12:29.461 --> 12:31.861
[SPEAKER_01]: Or at least that's what Fairwind said.

12:31.941 --> 12:32.962
[SPEAKER_00]: That's what Fairwind was...

12:33.362 --> 12:33.642
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

12:34.282 --> 12:34.502
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

12:36.682 --> 12:38.583
[SPEAKER_01]: No doubt that's where the hobgoblins came from.

12:39.773 --> 12:40.634
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

12:40.654 --> 12:42.817
[SPEAKER_01]: Or at least that seems like the most reasonable place.

12:42.837 --> 12:48.285
[SPEAKER_01]: We saw them sending ships back and forth to the cave and out and back.

12:48.325 --> 12:49.868
[SPEAKER_01]: That's where they were storing the powder.

12:50.308 --> 12:51.350
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, offloading it.

12:53.779 --> 13:01.282
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, I am going to have Lord Jamis send a flotilla of troops and ships to Helm Island.

13:01.502 --> 13:07.565
[SPEAKER_01]: And we are going to retake the smugglers' caves, get the remaining powder if there is any.

13:08.165 --> 13:12.988
[SPEAKER_01]: We have the area blockaded at this point.

13:13.828 --> 13:15.209
[SPEAKER_01]: So that will continue.

13:16.709 --> 13:20.691
[SPEAKER_01]: I wish to talk to you a little bit about the compatriots that you went with.

13:21.967 --> 13:24.429
[SPEAKER_01]: I understand that most of them were Marines.

13:24.969 --> 13:25.209
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

13:25.369 --> 13:26.550
[SPEAKER_01]: There were some men of note.

13:26.650 --> 13:34.515
