13:55.298 --> 13:56.659
[SPEAKER_01]: We've had meetings with him.

13:57.159 --> 13:58.220
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

13:58.260 --> 13:59.500
[SPEAKER_01]: What are your thoughts on these men?

14:01.601 --> 14:02.202
