14:08.886 --> 14:09.126
[SPEAKER_00]: No.

14:09.186 --> 14:12.087
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, they basically almost all witnessed the Marines.

14:15.475 --> 14:17.776
[SPEAKER_00]: When you say all, the barracks, the men and the barracks?

14:17.796 --> 14:18.217
[SPEAKER_00]: No, no, no, no.

14:18.297 --> 14:21.559
[SPEAKER_00]: It was, how many, there was five, was there five, yeah.

14:21.619 --> 14:24.880
[SPEAKER_00]: There was Merrick, Gouge, Jude was with me.

14:26.541 --> 14:26.962
[SPEAKER_00]: Folsom.

14:27.442 --> 14:28.142
[SPEAKER_00]: Folsom.

14:29.103 --> 14:29.543
[SPEAKER_00]: Tyrus.

14:29.683 --> 14:30.184
[SPEAKER_00]: Tyrus.

